Attribution
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Know Mods is an open-source Minecraft: Java Edition client for the Fabric
mod loader. It was created as a spiritual successor to, and takes inspiration
from, the open-source "Sol Client" project (also distributed as "Solar Client"):

    Sol Client
    Copyright (C) the Sol Client contributors
    Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0
    https://github.com/Sol-Client/Client

Sol Client targets legacy Minecraft (1.8.9) using a fundamentally different
toolchain, so no source code from Sol Client is reproduced here. All source
code in this repository is original work authored for Fabric on modern
Minecraft. Sol Client is credited here in accordance with its GNU GPL v3.0
license.

The Know Mods ClickGUI (com.heavenys.client.gui.ClickGuiScreen) is a
GPL-3.0 derivative work: its layout and behaviour are adapted from the design
of Sol Client's ModsScreen (centered rounded "block" panel, top search field,
scrollable module cards with descriptions, per-module settings area and a
smooth open animation). It was re-implemented from scratch against the
Minecraft 26.2 rendering API - no Sol Client source is copied - and remains
under the GNU GPL v3.0.

    Sol Client ModsScreen and GUI design
    Copyright (C) 2021-2023 TheKodeToad and Sol Client Contributors
    Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0

